  "duration": 152.16000366210938,
  "text": "Every wedding venue wants more enquiries, but that's not where most bookings are won or lost. They're won or lost in the moments after a couple gets in touch. The challenge is that most venues are leaking opportunities every single day. 81% of couples say they've felt frustrated by venue response times. Nearly 70% make their decision after visiting three venues or fewer. And almost 70% of wedding enquiries happen outside normal office hours. Think about that for a moment. Couples are choosing venues faster than ever, while many venues are still struggling to respond consistently. A couple visits your website, requests a brochure, books a tour, asks a question, waits for a reply. Every one of those moments either moves them closer to booking your venue, or closer to booking somebody else's. Most venues don't have an enquiry problem, they have a conversion problem. Opportunities are missed, follow-ups don't happen, teams get busy, and couples quietly disappear. That's exactly why we built VenuBot. VenuBot isn't a chatbot, and it isn't just another CRM. It's a complete enquiry-to-booking system, built specifically for wedding venues. Everything is organised around three connected pillars. Knowledge Engagement Control Studio AI gives you the knowledge to understand what makes your venue unique, identify opportunities, benchmark competitors, and improve the content and communication that influence booking decisions. Convert helps you engage every enquiry consistently, responding instantly, nurturing couples automatically, answering questions day and night, and ensuring no opportunity goes cold. Care gives your team complete control of the venue journey, bringing conversations, bookings, marketing, reporting, automation, and AI assistants together in one place. Knowledge Engagement Control More bookings, more confidence. That's VenuBot, and this is how it works.",
